# Stripe Payment Link for the freelancer subscription (€20/month).
# Create it in the Stripe dashboard (Payment Links → Subscription) and paste the URL.
# Test mode links look like https://buy.stripe.com/test_…
# Inlined at build time (PUBLIC_*), so it must be set when `astro build` runs.
# When unset, the onboarding falls back to the demo "finish" flow without payment.
PUBLIC_STRIPE_PAYMENT_LINK=
